{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_047_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8024118bcf6c1fcf16a638d32b882c6fda778f52b3d7fc86886cf29e4d750916",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14911e0e7df7696aaa0f24c79a4f2837a641febc329749fd550b61cd42e437ed",
      "text": "情人节巧克力？\n啊，我就知道你肯定会给。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f91168fbe396a63263506e20a4895793ed65c93f4e36ed1152f33fbaf53b864",
      "text": "毕竟像这种节日活动，\n你看起来就像是绝不会忘记的那种类型嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9686f3529ddd46c3ae8015e43ea128d4cc70ee06518cc9b68a205075fb40eea0",
      "text": "那么，里面是怎样的巧克力呢？\n……倾注了火热的Passion？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:452eb3ff505e78846fb3579f896bb06db53491483f3fb96264bbb84127426228",
      "text": "总觉得，会是跟你很像的、\n带着一股闷热劲头的巧克力啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cc67ec2648d0066e6520217f35f062c02531c7aed267a0ed8142207232bb37f",
      "text": "开玩笑的，我会心怀感激地收下的。\n然后，留到关键时刻再吃。谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6a76c610e37c58e72bdf729ad368717151c16a5804d32cd530aa5425eecb72",
      "text": "情人节巧克力？啊，多谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bcfaef852ce622abb4071509adf5071e760a02ada4708079ea976c14ed4c8e0",
      "text": "这个难道是……\n特意迎合我的喜好挑选的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4df68d965e5b6c72c39d9f8f76c72d5ad7b1592c48f1fe48b3cc6d5f3cbf7e06",
      "text": "收到虽然在我的预料之中，\n但这倒是在我的意料之外了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f2663fba3ad6ac75c31bba378b28235d6213740b265f4eccb1243606be517c5",
      "text": "你能开心，我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ae29389017f4542e1730670a27f5b259c4b504de34e7de63aeef4bc7051ae9",
      "text": "嗯。话说回来，挑起来很费劲吧。\n像这样照着别人的喜好挑选东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e493fb4fc82fa3693a2054e2b0263a5d102e082644dee648f64d9c8940e6598",
      "text": "我既高兴，又挺惊讶的。\n亏你能摸清我喜欢这种东西啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e47a1dd7e09d59010b8218e5001537b2f54fc9c14098b037a7d33326f089b2c4",
      "text": "啊——虽然高兴，但被你惊讶到还是稍微有点不爽。\n……决定了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_047_22:5_01_047_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f207610eb3f6b57884f7823e96441e4417dfc7cc240b2d96f69435e281f11864",
      "text": "我也会让你大吃一惊的，\n好好期待白色情人节的回礼吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
